  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/08/IMG_3568.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El ermitorio del Salvador, en Onda, cuenta desde la tarde de este viernes con un nuevo panel de fotograf&iacute;as antiguas y de 2013-14 relacionadas con el lugar. Tambi&eacute;n se han sustituido los dos grandes maceteros colocados esta semana por otros redondos, con menos aristas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotoselsalvador14/img_3568.jpg\" alt=\"img_3568\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotoselsalvador14/img_3569.jpg\" alt=\"img_3569\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotoselsalvador14/img_3570.jpg\" alt=\"img_3570\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotoselsalvador14/img_3571.jpg\" alt=\"img_3571\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotoselsalvador14/img_3573.jpg\" alt=\"img_3573\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotoselsalvador14/img_3574.jpg\" alt=\"img_3574\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotoselsalvador14/img_3575.jpg\" alt=\"img_3575\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotoselsalvador14/img_3577.jpg\" alt=\"img_3577\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotoselsalvador14/img_3578.jpg\" alt=\"img_3578\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715